---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Insights
description: "Practical notes on the commercial decisions that move margin for New Zealand FMCG suppliers: pricing, trade investment, portfolio mix and customer terms."
permalink: /insights/
---

<section class="shell hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Insights</p>
  <h1 class="display" style="margin-top:26px; max-width:16ch;">Notes from the trade.</h1>
  <p class="lede hero__lede">Practical pieces on the decisions that move margin, written for the people who have to make them.</p>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="posts" style="margin-top:0;">
      {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <a class="post-row{% if post.data.image %} post-row--media{% endif %}" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <div class="post-row__meta">
          {% if post.data.image %}
          <img class="post-row__thumb" src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="" width="150" height="96" loading="lazy">
          {% endif %}
          <b>{{ post.data.category }}</b>
          <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.date | displayDate }}</time>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
        </div>
        <span class="post-row__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--top" style="padding-top:var(--section);">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="starthere">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--pine">Start here</p>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:18px;">Not sure where the margin opportunity sits? That&rsquo;s a normal place to start.</h2>
      <p>Most engagements begin with a short, no-cost conversation about what&rsquo;s happening in your numbers.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Schedule an assessment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
